@startuml
!include style.iuml
hide empty description
[*] --> Active : onboarding completed
Active --> Active : weight recorded or profile changed\n/ recalculate targets
Active --> Reached : weight recorded\n[target weight reached]
Reached : entry / offer "maintain weight"
Reached --> Reached : user keeps the goal
Reached --> Replaced : user switches to "maintain"\nor sets a new goal
Active --> Replaced : user changes the goal
Replaced --> [*]
note right of Replaced
A new Active goal is created;
past days keep their targets.
end note
@enduml
